# ─── Agent/editor backup files ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Patch scripts drop these next to the file they edit. They are never
# deliverables, and leaving them untracked-but-not-ignored means every
# `git status` is noise and a stray `git add -A` commits them.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak2-*

# ─── Addon runtime state + secrets ───────────────────────────────────────
# The addon services deploy from source; their databases and credentials are
# per-host runtime data. addons/rule34/data/state.db alone is 1.9G.
addons/**/*.db
addons/**/*.key
addons/fansly/settings.json
addons/fansly/queue-*.json
addons/rule34/data/
